"<section id=\"how\"><div class=\"w\"><div class=\"eb\">How it works</div><h2>Four steps. <em>Zero guesswork.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\">Pick what you\u2019re here to do and we\u2019ll walk you through it.</p>",
"<div class=\"who\" id=\"who\"></div><div class=\"gd\"><div class=\"st\" id=\"st\"></div><div class=\"tp\"><h3>Trade smart</h3><ul id=\"tp\"></ul></div></div>",
"<h3 style=\"font-size:20px;margin-top:26px\">Quick answers</h3>",
"<details><summary>Is it free to join?</summary><p>Creating an account and browsing the market costs nothing.</p></details>",
"<details><summary>How do I know a seller is real?</summary><p>Check the profile, history and ratings, and keep every conversation inside TradeMate so there is a record.</p></details>",
"<details><summary>Can I sell more than one kind of thing?</summary><p>Yes. One account can list products, services, property, software or a whole business.</p></details>",
"<details><summary>What if something goes wrong?</summary><p>Every order is tracked under Deals, and the help centre is a tap away in the app.</p></details></div></section>",
"<section style=\"padding:8px 0 0\"><div class=\"w\"><div class=\"fin\"><div class=\"eb\">The market is yours</div><h2>What will you <em>bring to the market?</em></h2><p class=\"lead\">Join the people turning good connections into good business.</p><div class=\"cta\"><button class=\"btn\" data-login=\"up\">Enter TradeMate <svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M8 7h9v9\"/></svg></button></div></div>",
"<footer><span>TRADE SMART.</span><button class=\"lnk\" data-about>ABOUT US</button><span>TM / 2026</span></footer></div></section></div>",
"<div id=\"about\" class=\"abv hide\"><button class=\"bk\" id=\"bk2\" aria-label=\"Back\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 6l-6 6 6 6\"/></svg></button>",
"<div class=\"w\"><section style=\"padding-top:10px\"><div class=\"eb\">About us</div><h2>A market built on <em>real connections.</em></h2><p class=\"lead\">TradeMate is a global marketplace where people buy, sell and hire across products, services, real estate, businesses and software, all from one account.</p>",
"<div class=\"msn\"><div class=\"eb\" style=\"margin-bottom:8px\">Our mission</div><h3>Remove the friction between what you need and the people who can help.</h3><p>Good deals usually start with a good conversation. We build the place where that conversation happens directly, clearly and with a record of what was agreed.</p></div></section>",
"<section><div class=\"eb\">What we do</div><h2>Five markets. <span class=\"m\">One home.</span></h2><div class=\"ab5\" id=\"ab5\"></div></section>",
"<section><div class=\"eb\">How we work</div><h2>Built around <em>three ideas.</em></h2><div class=\"cg\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div><small>01 / DIRECT</small><h3>Talk to the source.</h3><p>Chat with the seller, provider or business behind every offer before you decide.</p><i></i></div><div><small>02 / CLEAR</small><h3>Know where you stand.</h3><p>Orders are tracked under Deals, from first message to final confirmation.</p><i></i></div><div><small>03 / OPEN</small><h3>One account, every market.</h3><p>Buy a product, hire a freelancer and list a property without switching apps.</p><i></i></div></div></section>",
"<section><div class=\"eb\">Who it\u2019s for</div><h2>Made for people <em>who make things happen.</em></h2><div class=\"who3\"><div class=\"tp\"><h3>Buyers</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--mut);font-size:13px\">Compare offers, check sellers and find what you need, from a gadget to a new home.</p></div><div class=\"tp\"><h3>Sellers</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--mut);font-size:13px\">Reach people already looking, with a profile that builds trust over time.</p></div><div class=\"tp\"><h3>Businesses</h3><p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--mut);font-size:13px\">Run a brand account, give your team access and grow through new connections.</p></div></div></section>",
"<section style=\"padding-bottom:0\"><div class=\"eb\">Trade with confidence</div><div class=\"tp\"><ul><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5 9-10\"/></svg>Identity verification when you set up your profile.</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5 9-10\"/></svg>Chat inside TradeMate, so every agreement is on record.</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5 9-10\"/></svg>Ratings and history to help you choose well.</li><li><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M5 12l5 5 9-10\"/></svg>Help centre and support inside the app.</li></ul></div>",
"<div class=\"fin\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><h2 style=\"font-size:clamp(26px,6vw,38px)\">Ready to <em>join the market?</em></h2><div class=\"cta\"><button class=\"btn\" data-login=\"up\">Create an account</button><button class=\"btn o\" data-login=\"in\">Log in</button></div></div>",
"<footer><span>TRADE SMART. TRADE DIRECT.</span><span>TM / 2026</span></footer></section></div></div>",
